cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Publications of results obtained substantially with this software must cite it as below (LICENSE.md section 5: the lfphys Research Licence 1.0, text of 14 November 2026, SPDX LicenseRef-lfphys-Research-1.0; PUBLICATIONS.md). Any other public use carries the line 'lfphys — Ildar Idrisov — https://github.com/ildar-idrisov/lfphys' (LICENSE.md section 5A). Questions: idrisov.sci@gmail.com"
title: "lfphys, a physics engine: established physics, widely used models and declared alternatives"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Idrisov
    given-names: Ildar
    email: idrisov.sci@gmail.com
contact:
  - family-names: Idrisov
