version: 0.1.0
abstract: "A Python physics engine with a core of established physics, each function tested against a closed form or an independent method (with certified Arb references), and, outside the core, layered approximations, interpretations, models and declared alternatives."
keywords:
  - physics engine
  - special relativity
  - general relativity
  - optics
  - quantum mechanics
  - QCD
  - certified numerics
